{"id":"5ed4d89a0622f889","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic.md","title":"栈顶作低位的 r 进制编码","display":"df-stack-base-r-arithmetic — 栈顶作低位的 r 进制编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic","aliases":["73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic"],"display":"df-stack-base-r-arithmetic — 栈顶作低位的 r 进制编码","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.4, proof of Theorem 8.14, print pp. 359–360; PDF pp. 381–382","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stack-base-r-arithmetic — 栈顶作低位的 r 进制编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.4, proof of Theorem 8.14, print pp. 359–360; PDF pp. 381–382"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；数字集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_r\">\\(D_r\\)</span> 在下式定义，后续子句取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in D_r^*\">\\(w\\in D_r^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in D_r\">\\(a\\in D_r\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StackNum}_r:D_r^*\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{StackNum}_r:D_r^*\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Push}_r:D_r\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{Push}_r:D_r\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pop}_r:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{Pop}_r:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 由断言中的公式定义；词左端为栈顶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_r\\coloneqq\\{1,\\ldots,r-1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_r\\coloneqq\\{1,\\ldots,r-1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{|w|-1}w(i)r^i,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Push}_r(a,m)\\coloneqq rm+a,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pop}_r(m)\\coloneqq\\lfloor m/r\\rfloor.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{|w|-1}w(i)r^i,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Push}_r(a,m)\\coloneqq rm+a,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pop}_r(m)\\coloneqq\\lfloor m/r\\rfloor.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\varepsilon)=0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\langle a\\rangle w)=\\operatorname{Push}_r(a,\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(w)),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pop}_r(\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\langle a\\rangle w))=\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(w),\\quad\n\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\langle a\\rangle w)\\bmod r=a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\varepsilon)=0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\langle a\\rangle w)=\\operatorname{Push}_r(a,\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(w)),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pop}_r(\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\langle a\\rangle w))=\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(w),\\quad\n\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\langle a\\rangle w)\\bmod r=a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u,v\\in D_r^*\\;(\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(u)=\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(v)\\Longrightarrow u=v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u,v\\in D_r^*\\;(\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(u)=\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(v)\\Longrightarrow u=v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>数字不允许为零，保证不会因高位零而混淆不同栈长度。空栈编码 0；若还保存底符，则把底符当作一个非零数字并在初始化中写入。乘常数、除常数及保存余数都能用单位加减与有限控制实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D_r","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in D_r^*","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in D_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StackNum}_r:D_r^*\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Push}_r:D_r\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pop}_r:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D_r\\coloneqq\\{1,\\ldots,r-1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{|w|-1}w(i)r^i,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Push}_r(a,m)\\coloneqq rm+a,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pop}_r(m)\\coloneqq\\lfloor m/r\\rfloor.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\varepsilon)=0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\langle a\\rangle w)=\\operatorname{Push}_r(a,\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(w)),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pop}_r(\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\langle a\\rangle w))=\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(w),\\quad\n\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(\\langle a\\rangle w)\\bmod r=a.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u,v\\in D_r^*\\;(\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(u)=\\operatorname{StackNum}_r(v)\\Longrightarrow u=v).","display":true}],"bytes":2008,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-stack-base-r-arithmetic|栈顶作低位的 r 进制编码]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"5fb4984fbec82c2e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}